  "slug": "navidrome-artist-role-order-by-sqli",
  "title": "A role name is not an SQL fragment",
  "description": "Navidrome treated an artist role as a small, enum-like value but inserted the raw request string into an SQL ORDER BY expression. Any authenticated web user could cross that syntax boundary and execute arbitrary SQL against the application database.",
